<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#Marker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An element that can contain neither text nodes nor elements."@en .
_:n2310ddb3cbc14762a79ca19ea8edb924b16 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
